<title>GAMBIA: SOCCER-REAL DE BANJUL COMPLETE GAMBIAN LEAGUE AND CUP DOUBLE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-REAL DE BANJUL COMPLETE GAMBIAN LEAGUE AND CUP DOUBLE.</headline>
<dateline>BANJUL 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Real de Banjul completed a league and cup double in Gambia when they defeated Hawks 1-0 in the Football Association Cup final on Sunday.</p>
<p>Mamadou Faye scored the winner in the seventh minute of extra-time. Real de Banjul had already won the league title.</p>
</text>
